    "source_assessment": "The far-runtime helpers and diversion are already in the current MOSLegalizerInfo.cpp and folded 0002. Removing and reapplying precisely 0013 reproduces the current source byte-for-byte.",
    "binary_assessment": "Captured llc and a reconstruction replacing only the legalizer object use identical other libraries. Identical prelegalizer MIR and input IR isolate the backend routing; the captured binary passes physical-memory checks. Hashes, versions, build commands, SDK, and headers are retained.",
    "decision": "No existing structured record covers this memset defect. This first canonical record migrates the June discovery and revalidates its existing repair, preserving original status text as dated evidence. The unrelated Imag8 truncation record describes another contract.",
