    "causal_explanation": "A non-inlined AS2 G_MEMSET falls through the generic memory-libcall builder without 0013. Its near __memset callee takes a 16-bit destination, while the caller passes a far pointer. Patch 0013 names __memset_far and supplies its far pointer and 16-bit length ABI. The same retained backend input and identical prelegalizer MIR fail only without this change; physical WRAM confirms its runtime effect.",
    "trigger_check": "The exact June C source emits llvm.memset.p2.i32 with destination 8265728, byte 66, length 4096. Both sides retain G_MEMSET with a p2 destination. The runner checks the fill call's relocation, target checksum, and all 4096 physical bytes independently on bsnes-jg. Focused constant/variable far and near IR checks also fail/pass on the isolated comparison in a16 and xy16.",
